      "title": "NC State Extension, Honey Bee Dance Language: the waggle dance communicates distance and direction; round dance under 50 m (distance, no direction), sickle dance about 50-150 m, waggle dance over 150 m; the bee runs straight while the abdomen wags, returns in a semicircle; waggle duration increases with distance, a 2.5 s waggle run recruits to food about 2,625 m away; the bee transposes the solar angle into the gravitational angle (food 60 degrees left of the sun = waggle run 60 degrees left of vertical); recruits follow the dancer",
